    <div class="card"><div class="ph" style="height:190px;margin-bottom:20px"><img src="/img/a26.webp" alt="The woods at camp"></div><h2 class="h3">Mission &amp; Story</h2><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:16px">Where the name came from and why camp exists.</p><a href="/about/mission/" class="lk">Learn more</a></div>
